      "writtenOn": "2024-04-09T04:05:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "They can be enabled separately but with certain dependency. \n\nThe flag `restrict_pkt_types_on_higher_settings` and `fix_sco_state_on_retry` have their own effects.\n\nEnabling `restrict_pkt_types_on_higher_settings` could result in different SCO settings and possibly causing some failure on headsets with only CVSD S1 capable.\n\nEnabling `fix_sco_state_on_retry` has unknown effects but the code is obviously a bug. IMO, we should fix further issues caused by this fix.\n\nThe flag `fix_cvsd_safe_setting_fallback` only takes effect when both `restrict_pkt_types_on_higher_settings` and `fix_sco_state_on_retry` are enabled.",
      "parentUuid": "2b8072c1_20073a8c",
